WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 12h: Galbadia Garden Mobilizes
Duration: 22 seconds
Context: Galbadia Garden, under Edea's control, activates its hidden hover mechanisms and becomes a massive flying fortress.
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The camera pans across a vast military compound surrounded by mountains. Galbadia Garden dominates the landscape below, a sprawling red-brown facility with angular architecture and military insignia visible across its structures. Banners flutter in the wind.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The ground beneath Galbadia Garden begins to rumble. Massive hover mechanisms hidden beneath the facility activate with a deep, mechanical roar. Dust and debris swirl around the base as the entire structure begins to lift. Soldiers in Galbadian uniforms scramble across exterior platforms, bracing themselves.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The enormous facility rises skyward. The massive red-brown structure tears itself free from the earth and ascends, towering over the mountains below. It transforms into a colossal flying fortress, its shadow darkening the landscape below. Metal groans from the exertion of flight.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Galbadian soldiers prepare throughout the facility. They don combat gear, check weapons, and move toward assault positions. Edea and Seifer stand in command, overseeing the mobilization. The Garden continues its ascent, now fully airborne and heading toward an unseen destination.